7,178,179],"redaction","pii","privacy",{"slug":181,"kind":150,"description":182,"keywords":183},"smart-typecheck","After a turn that edited code, runs the check script once in each package that was touched",[134,137,111,56,86]],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"item":1,"related":26},{"slug":2,"kind":3,"description":4,"keywords":5,"version":11,"html":12,"skills":13,"hooks":14,"files":16,"sources":21},"worktree-guard","hook","Refuses edits in the main checkout while another Claude session works there, and points you to a worktree.",[6,7,8,9,10],"hooks","git","worktree","parallel","sessions","1.0.0","\u003Ch2>What it does\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Refuses edits in a repo&#39;s main checkout while another live Claude session works there, and tells Claude to move to a git worktree. Without it, two sessions in one checkout write into each other&#39;s diff.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2>When to use it\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>You run several Claude sessions on the same repo at once.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>You keep one session in the main checkout and send the others to worktrees.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2>How it works\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Runs before \u003Ccode>Edit\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>Write\u003C/code> and \u003Ccode>NotebookEdit\u003C/code>, and before \u003Ccode>Bash\u003C/code> commands that move the checkout (\u003Ccode>git checkout\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>switch\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>pull\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>rm\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>mv\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>stash\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>reset\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>rebase\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>merge\u003C/code>).\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Finds other sessions in Claude Code&#39;s session registry and keeps those whose process is alive and whose working directory is the main checkout.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Files at the repo root and files inside the worktree directory are always allowed.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2>Configuration\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>WORKTREE_GUARD_DIR\u003C/code>: worktree directory, relative to the repo root. Default \u003Ccode>.claude/worktrees\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>WORKTREE_GUARD_SESSIONS\u003C/code>: session registry directory. Default \u003Ccode>${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/sessions\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>There is no override token. Move the other session or work in a worktree.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2>Requirements\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode>git\u003C/code> (2.31 or later for \u003Ccode>--path-format\u003C/code>) and \u003Ccode>jq\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",[],[15],"PreToolUse (Edit|Write|NotebookEdit|Bash)",[17,18,19,20],".claude-plugin/plugin.json","README.md","hooks/hooks.json","scripts/worktree-guard.sh",[22,24],{"path":19,"html":23},"\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hooks\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"PreToolUse\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"hooks\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shi